The aims of the College of Criminal Justice Education of Samar College include:
1. to train its intended clientele to be well-equipped with the needed knowledge on police matters that will serve as their primary toll in providing quality service to their respective communities;
2. to train its students to be highly-committed to the profession of police protection and security;
